{
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## S03 · 8 Compare with the model answers\n*Guide: Steps 7 and 8.*",
      "id": "class_s03_compare_0"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "For each question, read your answer and the model answer, and say whether yours says the same.",
      "id": "class_s03_compare_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "separator",
      "id": "class_s03_compare_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### 1. The three gateways\n**Yours:** {{self1}}\n\n**Model:** Exclusive: exactly one of several paths, chosen by conditions, with a default flow. Parallel: all paths, always, without conditions; its join waits for all of them. Inclusive: one or more paths, each with its own condition; its join waits only for the paths this instance started.",
      "id": "class_s03_compare_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "radio",
      "key": "rateSelf1",
      "label": "Does yours say the same?",
      "values": [
        {
          "label": "Yes, it says the same",
          "value": "yes"
        },
        {
          "label": "Partly",
          "value": "partly"
        },
        {
          "label": "No, I missed it",
          "value": "no"
        }
      ],
      "validate": {
        "required": true
      },
      "id": "class_s03_compare_4"
    },
    {
      "type": "separator",
      "id": "class_s03_compare_5"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### 2. Missing variables\n**Yours:** {{self2}}\n\n**Model:** With a missing variable, x = true compares null with true and gives false: the gateway gets a boolean and takes another flow or the default. x > 2 compares null with a number and gives null, and a gateway needs a boolean: incident. Guard it: x != null and x > 2.",
      "id": "class_s03_compare_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "radio",
      "key": "rateSelf2",
      "label": "Does yours say the same?",
      "values": [
        {
          "label": "Yes, it says the same",
          "value": "yes"
        },
        {
          "label": "Partly",
          "value": "partly"
        },
        {
          "label": "No, I missed it",
          "value": "no"
        }
      ],
      "validate": {
        "required": true
      },
      "id": "class_s03_compare_7"
    },
    {
      "type": "separator",
      "id": "class_s03_compare_8"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### 3. A join that waits forever\n**Yours:** {{self3}}\n\n**Model:** Start → exclusive gateway with two branches A and B → parallel join of A and B → end. Only one branch runs, so the join waits for a token that never comes.",
      "id": "class_s03_compare_9"
    },
    {
      "type": "radio",
      "key": "rateSelf3",
      "label": "Does yours say the same?",
      "values": [
        {
          "label": "Yes, it says the same",
          "value": "yes"
        },
        {
          "label": "Partly",
          "value": "partly"
        },
        {
          "label": "No, I missed it",
          "value": "no"
        }
      ],
      "validate": {
        "required": true
      },
      "id": "class_s03_compare_10"
    }
  ],
  "type": "default",
  "id": "class-s03-compare",
  "executionPlatform": "Camunda Cloud",
